key: WEB-9
format: markdown

Show a friendly 404 page

Unknown URLs show the server's default page.
Render templates/404.html instead — with the site header.

```html
<p>Keep this <b>as is</b></p>
```

## Notes

Design: see the mockups.

Acceptance criteria:
- Unknown URLs answer 404 with the template
- The header shows the current user
  - signed out: a sign-in link
- Static files still 404 plainly
